type: checklist
title: PR Review

- Tests pass [done]
  - unit
  - integration
- No type errors [done]: Strict TypeScript mode clean with no suppressions or any-casts
- Docs updated [done]
- Breaking changes noted: Migration path documented and deprecation notices added to all affected APIs
  - migration path
  - deprecation notes
- Performance impact checked: No p99 regression observed under sustained load testing
